{"q":"179","t":"Largest Number","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a list of non-negative integers <code>nums</code>, arrange them such that they form the largest number and return it.</p>\n\n<p>Since the result may be very large, so you need to return a string instead of an integer.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [10,2]\n<strong>Output:</strong> &quot;210&quot;\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [3,30,34,5,9]\n<strong>Output:</strong> &quot;9534330&quot;\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 100</code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10<sup>9</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"largestNumber\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"string\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Greedy","slug":"greedy"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"}],"s":[{"t":"Smallest Value of the Rearranged Number","s":"smallest-value-of-the-rearranged-number","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Find the Key of the Numbers","s":"find-the-key-of-the-numbers","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Josh Technology","josh-technology"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Meta","facebook"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Adobe","adobe"],["JTG","jtg"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Zoho","zoho"],["tcs","tcs"],["Accenture","accenture"],["Nykaa","nykaa"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Myntra","myntra"],["Works Applications","works-applications"]],"cs":{"a":[["Josh Technology","josh-technology",6],["Amazon","amazon",5],["Google","google",4],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",3],["Infosys","infosys",3],["Meta","facebook",2],["JTG","jtg",2]],"b":[["Microsoft","